---
// src/components/bangalore/WhatChangedAugust.astro
---
<section class="py-16 bg-white w-full border-b border-slate-100">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-md p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Decorative news badge -->
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-red-600 text-white text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-bl-lg">
        Recent News
      </div>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-3">
        What changed in August
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-800 font-bold mb-6">
        Bangalore restaurant associations took their complaints to Zomato and Swiggy.
      </p>
      
      <div class="space-y-4 mb-6">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-red-50 p-4 border border-slate-300 rounded-md">
          <div class="shrink-0 mt-1">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-slate-900 leading-snug">
            Swiggy agreed to refund offers you never approved.
          </h3>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-red-50 p-4 border border-slate-300 rounded-md">
          <div class="shrink-0 mt-1">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-slate-900 leading-snug">
            Zomato agreed to recheck old deductions, outlet by outlet.
          </h3>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border-t-4 border-slate-900 pt-6 mt-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-black text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wide mb-4">
          As reported by Economic Times and PTI, August 2026
        </p>
        <div class="bg-amber-400 p-4 rounded-md shadow-lg border border-slate-300">
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-900 font-black">
            Both need proof, order by order. That is what we build for you.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
